---
code: cli-file-permission-denied
when-fires: an input file exists but this process may not read it. cli/lib.rs humane_read_error, PermissionDenied arm. {kind} and {path}.
why: the read-error trichotomys second arm: the file is there, so the repair is permissions, not the path - a distinction the raw OS string buries.
